{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":false,"openWorldHint":false,"readOnlyHint":false},"description":"Apply exactly one action. Arguments: name (an action from list_actions), params (exactly that action's parameters), baseStep (the current step) and expectedRevision (the current revision), both from the latest observe or act reply; optional lang. On success the reply gives the new step and revision, the objects that changed (as they are now), the ids created and removed, and the current error explanations. A rejected action changes nothing: read error.code and error.message (a stale step or revision names the current ones), then choose a valid action. Never guess step or revision.","inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"baseStep":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"expectedRevision":{"maximum":9007199254740991,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"lang":{"enum":["en","de","both"],"type":"string"},"name":{"enum":["add_step","rename_step","move_step","connect","reconnect_end","disconnect","delete_step","resize_step","set_style","rename_frame","group_steps","ungroup","set_frame"],"type":"string"},"params":{"anyOf":[{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"add_step","properties":{"frameId":{"anyOf":[{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64}$","type":"string"},{"type":"null"}]},"height":{"maximum":4000,"minimum":10,"type":"integer"},"label":{"maxLength":8192,"minLength":0,"type":"string"},"shape":{"enum":["rectangle","ellipse","diamond"],"type":"string"},"width":{"maximum":4000,"minimum":10,"type":"integer"},"x":{"maximum":100000,"minimum":-100000,"type":"integer"},"y":{"maximum":100000,"minimum":-100000,"type":"integer"}},"required":["frameId","label","x","y","width","height","shape"],"type":"object"},{"additionalProperties":false,"description":"rename_step","properties":{"id":{"pattern":"^[A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,64}$","type":"string"},"label":{"maxLength":8192,"minLength